     <actual value="The contingent liabilities stemming from the state majority owned SOEs are incorporated into quantitative analysis carried out by the MEF after it receives their financial statements for publication on its website, but the analysis is not published in a separate report, although some information regarding SOEs liabilities is disclosed in other MEF periodic publications. The analysis of contingent liabilities covers most but not all of the state majority owned SOEs, as some have not provided their financial statements to the MEF, and delays in the submission of the 2018 and 2019 financial statements of JIRAMA (received by the MEF in May 2021) has resulted in contingent liabilities arising from them not being incorporated into such analysis at least until then."></actual>
